Output devpilot_demo.gif
Output devpilot_demo.mp4

Set FontSize 18
Set Width 1200
Set Height 800
Set Theme "Catppuccin Macchiato"
Set WindowBar Colorful
Set Padding 40

Type ".\.venv\Scripts\activate"
Enter
Sleep 1s

Type "devpilot info"
Sleep 500ms
Enter
Sleep 3s

Type "devpilot profile list"
Sleep 500ms
Enter
Sleep 3s

Type "devpilot setup --help"
Sleep 500ms
Enter
Sleep 5s
